    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liang Sheng, a young man in Kaifeng City, works as an apprentice in a blacksmith store run by his uncle. Due to the sudden departure of his uncle's family, Liang Sheng is forced to go out on a journey to track down the whereabouts of his uncle's family, but he uncovers years of buried martial arts secrets during the journey.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liang Sheng, a young man in Kaifeng City, works as an apprentice in a blacksmith store run by his uncle. Due to the sudden departure of his uncle's family, Liang Sheng is forced to go out on a journey to track down the whereabouts of his uncle's family, but he uncovers years of buried martial arts secrets during the journey.</p>",
    "short_description": "The game's main gameplay consists of conversations with NPCs, map exploration, and choices, with a small amount of non-essential turn-based combat. Clues and choices found during exploration will affect the game's plot, and more clues found beforehand in the plot will unlock more dialog and options.",
